==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
{{der+|eo|fr|consentir}}, {{der+|eo|it|consentire|nocap=1}}, ultimately {{der+|eo|la|cōnsentiō|cōnsentīre|t=to agree, accord, harmonize; to assent to|nocap=1}}. Compare {{cog|en|consent}}, {{cog|de|konsentieren}}, {{cog|es|consentir}}, {{cog|ca|consentir}}, {{cog|pt|consentir}}.

