====Usage notes====
For {{senseno|eo|admit that, consent}}: {{m|eo|akordi}} is a [[parasynonym]], as it expresses a natural, habitual commonality ([[accord]]) of opinions; while {{m|eo|konsenti}} in {{senseno|eo|admit that, consent}} means such commonality on a special point, obtained only after hesitation and/or discussion.

